<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM TEXAS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM TEXAS.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the first round of the Byron Nelson Classic golf tournament on Thursday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>64  Paul Stankowski, Dudley Hart</p>
<p>65  Tiger Woods, Tom Watson, Lee Rinker, Chris Perry, Kevin</p>
<p>    Sutherland, Eric Johnson</p>
<p>66  Nick Faldo (Britain), Craig Parry (Australia), Doug</p>
<p>    Martin, Justin Leonard, Andrew Magee, Rocco Mediate, Mike</p>
<p>    Standly, P.H. Horgan.</p>
<p>67  Glen Day, Dan Forsman, John Morse, Steve Pate</p>
<p>Add Regional Scores:</p>
<p>68  David Frost (South Africa) 69  Joe Ozaki (Japan), Nick Price (South Africa) 71  Sandy Lyle (Scotland) 72  Bradley Hughes (Australia) 77  Fulton Allem (South Africa)</p>
